<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
{% set seo_title = "The Options Desk Moved — MastermindX" %}
{% set seo_desc = "The per-name options desk now lives inside the consolidated Options workspace — one page for the settled close." %}
{% set seo_path = "options" ~ ".html" %}
{% include "_seo_head.html.j2" %}
<title>The Options Desk Moved — MastermindX</title>
<meta name="robots" content="noindex,follow">
<meta http-equiv="refresh" content="0;url=options.html#ticker">
<style>body{margin:0;min-height:100vh;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#0c0f16;color:#edf0f7;font:15px/1.5 system-ui,sans-serif}main{width:min(560px,calc(100% - 40px));padding:32px;border:1px solid #2a3040}h1{margin:0 0 10px;font-size:25px}p{color:#aab1c1}a{color:#8e97c8}</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>This desk moved into the Options workspace</h1>
<p>It now lives as the Ticker view of one consolidated page. You are being taken there — your symbol carries over.</p>
<p>本面板已并入期权工作台，现在是统一页面中的「个股」视图，正在为你跳转（标的会一并带过去）。</p>
<p><a id="go" href="options.html#ticker">Open the workspace → / 打开期权工作台 →</a></p>
</main>
<script>
(function(){
  /* gex.html deep links were hash-based (#NVDA). Carry the symbol into the
     workspace's ?t=SYM#ticker contract; anything that isn't a plausible symbol
     (or is a legacy mode word) falls back to the bare Ticker mode. */
  var h = (location.hash || '').replace(/^#/, '');
  var dest = 'options.html#ticker';
  if (/^[A-Za-z0-9.\-]{1,10}$/.test(h) && !/^(brief|flow|scanner|ticker|leaders)$/i.test(h)) {
    dest = 'options.html?t=' + encodeURIComponent(h.toUpperCase()) + '#ticker';
    var a = document.getElementById('go'); if (a) a.href = dest;
  }
  location.replace(dest);
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
